8908-Examples
8909-
8910-1. Extract the sign bit (bit 32) of register Ry and place the result right-justified into register Rx.
8911-
8912:extrwi Rx,Ry,1,0                                   (equivalent to:             rlwinm Rx,Ry,1,31,31)
8913-
8914-2. Insert the bit extracted in (1) into the sign bit (bit 32) of register Rz.
