codex
Book I’s word-form RTL uses `MASK(MB+32, ME+32)`. The PEM also says `rlwinm` clears the upper half, so there is a real conflict to resolve using Book I. I’m checking the surrounding mask definition and the status of the all-zero sentence before completing the arithmetic audit.

