Both corrections match Book I, and independent enumeration reproduces every reported count. The all-zero sentence is ordinary specification prose in both manuals; Book I’s inclusive mask definition also proves the assertion directly. For every wrapping word mask, the new helper adds exactly `0xFFFFFFFF00000000` and preserves every low-word bit.

